  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A spring of negligible mass is compressed and placed between two stationary masses m and M. The mass of M is twice that of m. The spring is released so that the masses move in opposite directions.</p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure></p>\n<p>What is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{\\textit{kinetic energy of m}}{\\textit{kinetic energy of M}}\"></span>?</p>\n<p>[1]</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{1}{2}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"B\">1</li><li data-label=\"C\">2</li><li data-label=\"D\">4</li></ol>"
  },
